  "source_ref": "Trenz TEI0022 PCB REV03 schematic, FMC.SchDoc sheet (p26) positionally joined to Cyclone V SoC U10 bank sheets (FPGA_Bank_8_9 p14: all LA + CLK0/1; FPGA_Bank_7A_7B p12: SCL/SDA on HPS I2C0-capable pins; FPGA_Bank_5 p9: PRSNT/PG); TEI0022 TRM v.54 Tables 4-6 corroborate. DP0 and GBTCLK0 connector positions carry labeled no-connect stubs (5CSEMA5 has no transceivers) and are omitted. FMC JTAG (D29-D34) routes only to the MAX10 board-management FPGA U41 and is omitted. PRSNT_M2C_L and PG_C2M each also tee to an HPS-bank ball (C18 / H17, bank 7C-7D sheet p13); the fabric bank-5B balls (AA28 / W25) are recorded. VREF_A_M2C reaches VREFB8AN0 ball B10, excluded per repo convention.",
